      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "To the few who are currently unable to use the YouTube player and animation player in the game after the VRCHAT UNITY2019 update.\nSymptom: After starting the game in VRCHAT, the first movie can be played, but the subsequent movies cannot be played\nSolution:\n・First turn on the NVIDIA Control Panel in the computer\n・After opening, click \"Manage 3D Settings\" in 3D Settings\n・After clicking on, change the \"Vertical Sync\" option in \"Wide Area Settings\" to \"3D application settin\"\n・Turn off the \"Vertical Sync\" of VRCHAT in the \"Program Settings\" next to the wide area setting (if you don't see the VRCHAT option, please add it yourself)\nAfter the above four points are used, test it in the game to see if the animation player can play it!\nI wish everyone can use this method to solve your problem.\nThis solution comes from Master Tony_Lewis\nOS:WIN10\nCPU:I9-9900K\nGPU:NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
